  annotation = {TLDR: Baba: an integrated domain-specific language (DSL) and visual analysis system for authoring and reviewing multiverse analyses and demonstrates Boba's utility through two data analysis case studies, and reflects on challenges and design opportunities for multiverse analysis software.},
